<title>USA: Abaxis says Japan approved blood analyzer.</title>
<headline>Abaxis says Japan approved blood analyzer.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABAXIS Inc Monday said Japanese regulators approved its VetScan Blood Analyzer for marketing and distribution to veterinarians in Japan.</p>
<p>In a statement, ABAXIS said its Japanese distributor ordered about 100 blood analyzers, adding to the 59 units already shipped to Japan in anticipation of the launch. Units will be installed at customer sites as early as August.</p>
<p>The approval was given by the Japanese Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fishery (Nosuisho).</p>
